style=\"width:21px\"></span><span class=\"mk-icon-btn\">⬇</span><span style=\"width:7px\"></span><span class=\"mk-icon-btn\">⋯</span></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"container\"><span class=\"cardgrid-anat-box\"><span class=\"cardgrid-anat-cell\"></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"card\"><span class=\"cardgrid-anat-cell on\">卡片</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"gap\"><span class=\"cardgrid-anat-gap\"></span></span><span class=\"cardgrid-anat-cell\"></span><span class=\"cardgrid-anat-cell\"></span></span></span></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"container\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">网格容器</span><span class=\"pe\">Container</span></button><span class=\"pd\">display: grid，定义列和间距</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"card\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">卡片</span><span class=\"pe\">Card</span></button><span class=\"pd\">结构一致的成员，同构才好扫读</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"gap\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">网格间距</span><span class=\"pe\">Gap</span></button><span class=\"pd\">格子之间的缝，一处声明全管</span></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">常见变体 · Variants</div><div class=\"variant-grid\"><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">自适应列<span>AutoFill</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(22px,1fr));gap:4px;width:110px\"><i class=\"cardgrid-v-cell\"></i><i class=\"cardgrid-v-cell\"></i><i class=\"cardgrid-v-cell\"></i><i class=\"cardgrid-v-cell\"></i></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">卡片有合理最小宽度、